   DFD2BWP7T40P140 BSG_OSDR_DFFPOS_BSG_DONT_TOUCH
   (.D(~(clk_r_p|reset_i)),.CP(clk_i),.Q(clk_r_p), .QN());

From 9343f269cb50bcc62bdf80049417045bf876b66e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Gao <gaozihou@uw.edu>
Date: Mon, 4 Nov 2024 00:48:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] add explicit conditional generate constructs

---
 hard/gf_14/bsg_link/bsg_link_osdr_phy.sv   | 2 +-
 hard/tsmc_28/bsg_link/bsg_link_osdr_phy.sv | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

